cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ACGS in your research, please cite it using this metadata."
title: "ACGS: receipt-gated runtime governance for AI-agent side effects"
abstract: >-
  ACGS is a vendor-neutral, receipt-gated governance layer that sits
  immediately before an AI agent can change files, infrastructure, data,
  communications, or money. It evaluates policy, issues a Decision Receipt binding
  the actor, action, exact arguments, tenant, and policy evidence, and lets a
  governed executor proceed only when that receipt verifies (no valid Decision
  Receipt, no side effect). This repository provides local engineering evidence;
  it is not production-certified, compliance-certified, or regulator-approved.
type: software
